<title>USA: AMETEK sets Culligan exchange ratio.</title>
<headline>AMETEK sets Culligan exchange ratio.</headline>
<dateline>PAOLI, Pa. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMETEK Inc said it established the final  exchange ratio for the distribution of common shares of Culligan Water  Technologies Inc in exchange for the merger of AMETEK's water filtration  business.</p>
<p>AMETEK said its shareholders of record on July 31 will recieve 0.105  share of Culligan common stock for each share of AMETEK.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the merger was completed earlier  Friday.</p>
